{"results":[{"url":"https://www.samsung.com/in/support/service-center/","final_url":"https://www.samsung.com/in/support/service-center/","title":"Find a Samsung Service Center | Samsung Support India","description":"Find all the information you need for your Samsung products at our Service Center Page on Samsung.com. Whether you own a TV, Mobile, Home Appliances, or a Galaxy Book, our comprehensive guide provides details on service center locations, contact information, and support services. Get expert assistance, repair solutions, and maintenance tips to keep your Samsung devices running smoothly.","language":"en","text":"×\n\n\\*Offer Ending Soon! Get 5% Off Coupon\n\n\\*Offer Ending Soon! Get 5% Off Coupon\n\nGrab Now\n\n## Maintenance mode\n\nMaintenance mode protects your privacy while someone else is using your phone, such as **when you are sending it for repairs**. This new privacy feature blocks access to your data for peace of mind while it is out of sight. In Maintenance mode, your personal data, including pictures, messages, and accounts, cannot be accessed, and only preinstalled apps are available.   \n  \nYou will need to unlock your phone to turn off Maintenance mode.\n\n## Find a Service Center\n\n### TV & AV\n\n* All\n* Television\n* Soundbar/SoundTower\n* Home Theatre\n* Wireless Audio\n* Projector\n* Blu-ray\n* MP3/MP4 Player\n* DVD\n\n### Mobile Phone\n\n* All\n* Mobile Device\n\n### Home Appliance\n\n* All\n* Refrigerator\n* Washing Machine\n* Air/Shoe Dresser\n* Cooking\n* Vacuum\n* Air Conditioner\n\n### PC & Office\n\n* All\n* Galaxy Book (Laptops)\n\n### Displays\n\n* All\n* Monitors\n* Signage\n* Hospitality TVs\n\n### Storage\n\n* All\n* Solid State Drive\n\n### Camera & Camcorder\n\n* All\n* Camcorder\n* Camera\n* Lens\n\n### Healthcare\n\n### How to search\n\n**To find your closest Service Center,  \n please follow the steps below.**\n\n1. Select product category from the above options   \n( Mobile device, Home Appliance etc.)  \n  \n2. Enter your city, town or post code  \n  \n3. If no results appear, please increase the search radius   \n(10 KM, 20 KM, etc.)\n\n#### Need assistance?\n\nPlease reach out to us at  \n● India (Call or WhatsApp): 1800-5-7267864  \n● Nepal (WhatsApp): 16600172667  \n● Sri Lanka (WhatsApp): +94-11-7267864  \n  \nFor Displays, Storage, or Healthcare products  \n● India (Call): 1800-30-7267864\n\nSIDE MENU\n\nback to list\n\n####\n\n* **Address**\n* **Operating Hours**\n\n* **Phone Number**\n* **E-mail**\n* **Website**\n* Reserve\n\n\\* Please note, we advise you to contact Service Center to ensure that your product can be repaired at that location\n\n##### Handling Products\n\n\n\nReserve\n\nSIDE MENU\n\n### Map\n\n## Phone service at your door step\n\n### Pick and Drop @ just Rs 199\\* Drop Service @ just Rs 99\\*\n\n\\*T & C Apply. Service applicable within India\n\n## Book an online appointment\n\n### Get priority at the service center\\* For Mobile/Tablet/Wearable\n\n\\*T & C Apply. Service applicable within India\n\nInquiry parts\n\n## Contact Info\n\n### Digital Service Center\n\nGet customized support, access to DIY videos and FAQs, or schedule a callback request to connect with an expert.  \n  \n  \n  \nScan to access\n\nClick here\n\n### WhatsApp\n\nWhatsApp us for services-related interaction.  \nAvailable 24 Hours / 7 days  \nWhatsApp@  1-800-5-726-7864  \n  \n  \nScan to access\n\nClick here\n\n### Chat\n\nChat with us for assistance with product technical support, service center information, spare part cost, and additional services.  \n**Languages offered:** English/ हिन्दी/ Indian Regional Languages\n\nClick here\n\n### Email Support\n\nWe'll respond within 24 hours of your request.\n\nEmail Us\n\n### Remote Service\n\nRemote diagnostics by our specially trained technicians for your Galaxy device and Samsung TV\n\n### CEO Office\n\nShare feedback to CEO office & relevant team will get in touch with you promptly.\n\n### Phone Support (India)\n\n**Available: 9 AM to 7 PM | Monday to Saturday**  \n  \n\n**1-800-5-7267864**\n\n### Phone Support (Bangladesh, Sri Lanka, Nepal)\n\n### Apps & Services Customer Support\n\nSamsung Pay : 1800-123-7729\n\nView more\n\nRC01\\_Static Content : This text is only displayed on the editor page","author":null,"published_date":"2026-08-13","links":["https://www.samsung.com/in/support/service-center/#content","https://www.samsung.com/in/info/privacy/","https://www.samsung.com/in/","https://shop.samsung.com/in/cart","https://www.samsung.com/in/offer/","https://www.samsung.com/in/mobile/find-your-galaxy/","https://www.samsung.com/in/buy-direct-get-more/","https://www.samsung.com/in/offer/samsung-care-plus/","https://www.samsung.com/in/offer/exchange/","https://www.samsung.com/in/rewards/","https://www.samsung.com/in/business/offers/","https://www.samsung.com/in/offer/student-discount/","https://www.samsung.com/in/multistore/in_corporate/prelogin/","https://www.samsung.com/in/galaxy-forever/","https://www.samsung.com/in/live-shop/","https://www.samsung.com/in/ai-living/","https://www.samsung.com/in/smartthings/","https://www.samsung.com/in/offer/finance-plus/","https://www.samsung.com/in/samsung-experience-store/","https://www.samsung.com/in/store/samsung-bkc/","https://www.samsung.com/in/smartphones/all-smartphones/","https://www.samsung.com/in/smartphones/galaxy-z-fold8-ultra/","https://www.samsung.com/in/smartphones/galaxy-z-fold8/","https://www.samsung.com/in/smartphones/galaxy-z-flip8/","https://www.samsung.com/in/smartphones/galaxy-s26-ultra/","https://www.samsung.com/in/smartphones/galaxy-s/galaxy-s26-fe-pistachio-256gb-sm-s741blgcins/","https://www.samsung.com/in/tablets/galaxy-tab-s/galaxy-tab-s12-ultra-gray-256gb-sm-x940nzaainu/","https://www.samsung.com/in/smartphones/","https://www.samsung.com/in/smartphones/galaxy-s/","https://www.samsung.com/in/smartphones/galaxy-z/","https://www.samsung.com/in/smartphones/galaxy-a/","https://www.samsung.com/in/smartphones/galaxy-m/","https://ww